Magic=
Despite her appearing to use a special version of [[Protect from Magic]]/Missiles, it is just to show off her increased Magic/Ranged defensive stats. With a Tumeken's shadow, players can opt to save inventory space for longer trips between banking or bring additional gear.
<br>
If the player does not have access to Tumeken's shadow or Eye of Ayak, magic can be used for phase 1 as well, but magic weapons benefit from many gear switches and do not perform as well as most ranged weapons.
<br>
If you have both the Eye of Ayak and Tumeken's shadow, then the following strategy is possible. Whilst stood under the Kalphite queen, equip the Eye of Ayak. Attack the Kalphite queen, and immediately switch to Tumeken's shadow one you have attacked with the Eye of Ayak. Once you have attacked with the Tumeken's shadow, step back under the Kalphite queen. The Kalphite queen attacks every 4 ticks, so this attack pattern allows you to get an additional hit with the Eye of Ayak between each hit from the Kalphite queen compared to just attacking with the Tumeken's shadow alone.
